			"url": "https://github.com/home-assistant/architecture/issues/230",
			"summary": "The opener argues that resetting `last_changed` and `last_updated` on every restart makes every entity look recently changed, rebuts a forum claim that restarts are rare, and proposes either not resetting those timestamps or adding a new restart-proof timestamp.",
			"actorId": 14320018,
			"actorType": "human"
		},
